# Kconfig include for main-tree KernelSU/SUSFS integration.
# CONFIG_KSU is defined via drivers/Kconfig -> drivers/kernelsu/Kconfig
# (symlink to KernelSU-Next/kernel/Kconfig).
# CONFIG_KSU_SUSFS is defined in KernelSU-Next/kernel/Kconfig (shared via symlink).
# This file is intentionally left empty to avoid duplicate symbol definitions
# with the shared KernelSU-Next Kconfig when both trees build together.
